\u00e4ltetechnik) spielerisch entdecken und erste berufstypische Aufgaben ausprobieren. Ob Technik, Gesundheit oder Handwerk \u2013 finde heraus, was dir am meisten Spa\u00df macht! :)\n\nEarly Access: Sei unter den Ersten, die jobVRiety testen!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "3902217326706597", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_3902217330039930_1240378813803928232_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BgSwD4XuG5AQ7kNvwHKyaa_&_nc_oc=AdpOZorQIQYE5oReeDOOnYcISzvXmuW4LEXQcMGvHtLId3ETViCsspmqyDVo7JF1ny8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQE7QaBNeswUtgB2ySAG4VI2Pej7CTGRG9fLIY2R-LEXg&oe=6B01CEF6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_1080x360.png", "id": "3076099412552471", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825091_3076099415885804_5417180118801740963_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q7cQrwKGr0IQ7kNvwHKPxat&_nc_oc=AdrbHBx3s9qS5qjln5ezK7J9k7SVALCmxAq0koeUd_vmB5E3ieE7UdW7lAyzM-Jhf1c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRCQS7alH37Et_l1H-aTIYeyarxbv0cneZTd973CFJWxQ&oe=6B01CAF6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare_1440x1440.png", "id": "2448391595528830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824609_2448391598862163_943533169723644988_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SVSYCZs-dFEQ7kNvwEyM5sd&_nc_oc=Adr5k3x5_VRAmwEWTU-7QpUsT2OO4bFfGKIOodDfctjnNms5WxpRgzqtLCkgX071Uao&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS1AbRHvxOg5cxQX2dnuXHozvopDR1QjfwpEDTbFp8PSw&oe=6B01CF7E"}, {"file_name": "JobVR_LogoClaim_rgb.png", "id": "1748084809102207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "u